        "subject": "Rotate tunnel credentials",
        "description": {
          "format": "markdown",
          "raw": "## Goal\n\nRotate the **Cloudflare tunnel** credentials on the edge host and update [the runbook](https://wiki.example.test/runbooks/tunnel). Steps:\n\n- revoke the old token\n- issue a new one via `cloudflared tunnel token`\n- restart `cloudflared.service`\n\nCheck gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. Check gatus afterwards &amp; confirm every external endpoint is green. ",
